audio.doc:
Audio datasets: clip archives decoded to PCM sample matrices and MIDI
//! performances decoded to `(pitch, step, duration)` event matrices.
//!
//! Waveform loaders upload a `[N, 1, S]` F32 sample matrix and a `[N]` F32
//! label matrix, so per-sample slices collate through [`oa::data`] the same
//! way image batches do. Sequence loaders expose fixed-length event windows
//! as device slices, so batches collate without padding.

image.doc:
Image datasets: IDX-digit packs and archive-decoded photographic corpora.
//!
//! Every loader uploads a `[N, C, H, W]` F32 image matrix and a `[N]` F32
//! label matrix, so per-sample slices collate to NCHW batches through
//! [`oa::data`].

video.doc:
Video datasets: frame-sequence corpora.
//!
//! Loaders upload a `[N, T, C, H, W]` F32 frame tensor; per-sample slices
//! collate to NTCHW batches through [`oa::data`].

tabular.doc:
Tabular datasets: fixed-width numeric feature matrices with class labels.
//!
//! Every loader uploads a `[N, F]` F32 feature matrix and a `[N]` F32
//! label matrix, so per-sample slices collate to `[B, F]` batches through
//! [`oa::data`]. Packs arrive unsplit; partition with
//! [`oa::data::random_split`].
